{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">亞運奪金的武術及賽艇港隊同日凱旋。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.WUSHU.BACK-2200.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026pTcsngCJ8U1790348640.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.WUSHU.BACK-2200.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">武術隊於套路及散打，共奪1金2銀1銅，沈曉榆第三次出戰，放棄全能，專注長拳，終於首奪獎牌。亦是繼教練耿曉靈後，武術隊相隔16年，另一面亞運金牌。劉子龍南拳南棍全能奪銀。幾位代表均首登亞運頒獎台，梁宇航及陳紫晴分獲銀牌及銅牌，同樣創散打隊歷史。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.WUSHU.BACK-2200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20261Azx9wUKtC1790348660.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.WUSHU.BACK-2200_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">賽艇隊同樣1金2銀1銅，三戰亞運的趙顯臻今屆奪金，集齊三色獎牌。洪詠甄在女子輕量級單人雙槳，梁穎桉及張菀珊在輕量級雙人雙槳齊齊奪銀。銅牌屬於男子輕量級雙人雙槳的陳迪麟及林新棟。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T15:40:00.566392+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":228,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}